android-start-activity: launch a component with intent extras (eservo)

Adds the android-start-activity primitive (COMPONENT &optional
EXTRAS-ALIST): EmacsService.startActivityByName (Java) + a DEFUN in
androidfns.c (C).  eservo's on-device lane launches the servo app
with devtools enabled, no adb.  Consumed by eservo-servo.el
(already landed, guarded by fboundp).

Applies with: patch -p1 < patches/emacs/0002-android-start-activity.patch

